{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2022-02-25 16:19:00', 'title': 'RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ST. PETERSBURG, FLA., FEB. 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ON FEBRUARY 25, 2022, THE RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: RJF) BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.34 PER SHARE, PAYABLE APRIL 18, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON APRIL 4, 2022.'}